{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "root": {
    "type": "Grid",
    "props": { "columns": 12, "gap": 16 },
    "children": [

      {
        "type": "Card",
        "props": { "span": 12, "title": "APIs & externe Schnittstellen", "variant": "hero" },
        "data": { "dataset": "summary" },
        "children": [
          { "type": "KPIStrip",
            "props": {
              "items": [
                { "label": "Open URL",        "field": "open_url_steps",       "format": "number",
                  "onClick": { "action": "openDashboard",
                               "args": { "id": "external_apis",
                                         "params": { "step_name": "Open URL" } } } },
                { "label": "Insert from URL", "field": "insert_url_steps",     "format": "number",
                  "onClick": { "action": "openDashboard",
                               "args": { "id": "external_apis",
                                         "params": { "step_name": "Insert from URL" } } } },
                { "label": "Import Records",  "field": "import_records_steps", "format": "number",
                  "onClick": { "action": "openDashboard",
                               "args": { "id": "external_apis",
                                         "params": { "step_name": "Import Records" } } } },
                { "label": "MBS / Plugin",    "field": "mbs_plugin_hits",      "format": "number",
                  "onClick": { "action": "openDashboard",
                               "args": { "id": "external_apis",
                                         "params": { "ref_type": "Plugin" } } } },
                { "label": "Web Viewer",      "field": "web_viewer_hits",      "format": "number",
                  "onClick": { "action": "openDashboard",
                               "args": { "id": "external_apis",
                                         "params": { "context": "Web Viewer" } } } },
                { "label": "Calculations",    "field": "calc_step_hits",       "format": "number",
                  "onClick": { "action": "openDashboard",
                               "args": { "id": "external_apis",
                                         "params": { "source_type": "Script (Calc Step)" } } } },
                { "label": "Eindeutige URLs", "field": "distinct_urls",        "format": "number" },
                { "label": "Externe Quellen", "field": "external_sources",     "format": "number" }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },

      {
        "type": "Card",
        "props": { "span": 12, "title": "API-Familien" },
        "data": { "dataset": "api_families" },
        "children": [
          { "type": "Table",
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "api_family",
              "density": "comfortable",
              "sortable": true,
              "columns": [
                { "field": "api_family",      "label": "Familie" },
                { "field": "hits",            "label": "Hits",            "align": "right" },
                { "field": "hosts",           "label": "Hosts",           "align": "right" },
                { "field": "urls",            "label": "URLs",            "align": "right" },
                { "field": "files",           "label": "Dateien",         "align": "right" },
                { "field": "script_step",     "label": "Script Step",     "align": "right", "format": "count" },
                { "field": "plugin",          "label": "Plugin",          "align": "right", "format": "count" },
                { "field": "layout_object",   "label": "Layout Object",   "align": "right", "format": "count" },
                { "field": "field",           "label": "Field",           "align": "right", "format": "count" },
                { "field": "custom_function", "label": "Custom Function", "align": "right", "format": "count" }
              ],
              "onRowClick": { "action": "openDashboard",
                              "args": { "id": "external_apis",
                                        "params": { "api_family": "{{api_family}}" } } }
            }
          }
        ]
      },

      {
        "type": "Card",
        "props": { "span": 12, "title": "URL-Detailliste" },
        "data": { "dataset": "url_details" },
        "children": [
          { "type": "Table",
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "url",
              "density": "compact",
              "sortable": true,
              "columns": [
                { "field": "api_family",  "label": "Familie",      "format": "badge" },
                { "field": "ref_type",    "label": "Ref-Typ",      "format": "badge" },
                { "field": "host",        "label": "Host" },
                { "field": "name",        "label": "Script/Kontext" },
                { "field": "file",        "label": "Datei" },
                { "field": "context",     "label": "Step/Typ" },
                { "field": "step_index",  "label": "#",            "align": "right" },
                { "field": "url",         "label": "URL" }
              ],
              "onRowClick": { "action": "openObject",
                              "args": { "uuid": "{{target_uuid}}",
                                        "type": "{{target_type}}",
                                        "file": "{{file}}",
                                        "params": { "step":  "{{step_uuid}}",
                                                    "types": "{{layout_filter_types}}" } } }
            }
          }
        ]
      },

      {
        "type": "Card",
        "props": { "span": 12, "title": "Externe Datenquellen (FileMaker / ODBC)" },
        "data": { "dataset": "external_sources" },
        "children": [
          { "type": "Table",
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "name",
              "density": "compact",
              "sortable": true,
              "columns": [
                { "field": "name",            "label": "Ziel" },
                { "field": "type",            "label": "Typ",          "format": "badge" },
                { "field": "used_in_files",   "label": "Dateien",      "align": "right" },
                { "field": "to_count",        "label": "TOs",          "align": "right" },
                { "field": "sample_to_name",  "label": "Beispiel-TO" }
              ],
              "onRowClick": { "action": "openObject",
                              "args": { "uuid": "{{sample_to_uuid}}",
                                        "type": "TableOccurrence" } }
            }
          }
        ]
      },

      {
        "type": "Markdown",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "content": "## Hinweise\n\nDieses Dashboard ist eine **generische Vorlage** zur Übernahme in andere FileMaker-Projekte. Die API-Familien-Klassifikation deckt typische Cloud-/SaaS-/Communication-/AI-Anbieter ab. Für projektspezifische Familien die `CASE WHEN url ILIKE …`-Blöcke in `data/url_details.sql` und `data/api_families.sql` synchron anpassen (siehe Kopfkommentar in `url_details.sql`).\n\n- **KPIs als Filter** (über alle API-Familien hinweg): *Open URL*, *Insert from URL* zählen Script-Steps des jeweiligen Typs mit URL im Step-Text. *Import Records* zählt **alle** Import-Records-Steps, unabhängig von der Quelle (file/URL/Variable) — als Schnittstellen-Indikator. *MBS / Plugin* zählt URLs in Calcs mit MBS-/CURL-/Files-Aufrufen. *Web Viewer* zählt Web-Viewer-Quellen aus Layouts. *Calculations* zählt Script-Step-Formeln (Set Variable, Set Field, If …). *Eindeutige URLs* und *Externe Quellen* sind reine Statistik-Tiles ohne Filter.\n- **API-Familien-Tabelle**: Klick auf eine Familien-Zeile filtert die Detailliste. Klick auf *Alle* setzt den Filter zurück. Die Spalten *Script Step*, *Plugin*, *Layout Object*, *Field*, *Custom Function* zeigen, wie sich die URLs einer Familie auf die Referenztypen verteilen; 0-Werte sind ausgeblendet.\n- **Ref-Typ**: `Plugin` überschreibt den Container-Typ, wenn der Calc-Text MBS- oder Plugin-Funktionen aufruft (`CURL.*`, `MBS(…)`, `Files.*`, `Plugin.*`).\n- **Quellen**: `Script (URL Step)` = `Open URL`/`Insert from URL`. `Script (Import)` = alle `Import Records`. `Script (Calc Step)` = Schritte mit URL im Formelausdruck. `Custom Function` = URL im CF-Body. `Field` = Calculated- oder AutoEnter-Formel. `Layout Object` = Hide/Tooltip/Label/Trigger-Param oder Web-Viewer-Quelle.\n- **Secret-Maskierung**: Query-Parameter `api_key`, `token`, `password`, `secret`, `auth`, `signature` werden in der URL-Spalte auf `[masked]` reduziert.\n- **Navigation**: Klick auf eine Detail-Zeile öffnet das passende Objekt (Script + Step-Anchor, Custom Function, Field, Layout — bei Web Viewer zusätzlich mit Layout-Filter `Container,Web Viewer`). Klick auf eine externe Datenquelle öffnet die alphabetisch erste TableOccurrence dieser Quelle.\n- **Sortierung**: Spaltenüberschriften in API-Familien, URL-Detailliste und Externen Datenquellen sind klickbar (▲▼)."
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
